  "term": "family life education",
  "definition": "Family life education is a school-administered program in Virginia that includes sex education with an abstinence-based component. Local school districts may decide whether to add material on sexual health, contraceptives, and sexually transmitted infections, and parents may opt children out of any part of the program.",
